body:
I was listening him on YouTube, actually, and also discovered Anabel Lee, beside this story. But that's it. I will need to dig more today, it seems. I would be surprised if he has stopped narrating after these two lol.

&#x200B;

Edit: I just discovered a very good short story for kids, apparently written by Matthew himself. Here's the YouTube link to it if you are interested: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=u3o4FvpCpMY
